## Root-level .dockerignore
## Each service Dockerfile uses its own directory as build context,
## so this file mainly guards against accidental large-context builds.

# .NET build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Visual Studio / Rider IDE files
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

# Node / Angular
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.angular/

# Environment secrets
.env

# Git
.git/
.github/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

